====Candidates that failed registration====
Andrej Deivis Ginevičas, [[Antanas Kandrotas]], Irma Gajauskaitė, and Jonas Jankauskas were denied formal registration as candidates due to their failure to provide all relevant documents during the registration process.<ref>{{cite web |title=Asmenys, kuriuos atsisakyta registruoti rinkimų politinės kampanijos dalyviais |url=https://www.vrk.lt/en/asmenys-kuriuos-atsisakyta-registruoti-rinkimu-politines-kampanijos-dalyviais-2024-pr |publisher=Central Electoral Commission |access-date=16 December 2023 |language=lt |archive-date=16 December 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231216184135/https://www.vrk.lt/en/asmenys-kuriuos-atsisakyta-registruoti-rinkimu-politines-kampanijos-dalyviais-2024-pr |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite news | title=Jonas Jankauskas neregistruotas dalyvauti Prezidento rinkimuose | work=15min.lt | date=20 February 2024 | url=https://www.15min.lt/naujiena/aktualu/lietuva/jonas-jankauskas-neregistruotas-dalyvauti-respublikos-prezidento-rinkimuose-56-2194996 | language=lt | access-date=20 February 2024 | archive-date=20 February 2024 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240220151003/https://www.15min.lt/naujiena/aktualu/lietuva/jonas-jankauskas-neregistruotas-dalyvauti-respublikos-prezidento-rinkimuose-56-2194996 | url-status=live }}</ref>

[[Petras Gražulis]] was denied registration as a candidate due to his [[#Ineligible candidates|ineligibility for the office]], as he had been impeached by the Seimas in 2023.<ref>{{cite news |title=Atsisakyta registruoti Petrą Gražulį Prezidento rinkimų politinės kampanijos dalyviu |url=https://www.15min.lt/naujiena/aktualu/lietuva/atsisakyta-registruoti-petra-grazuli-respublikos-prezidento-rinkimu-politines-kampanijos-dalyviu-56-2193910 |work=15min.lt |language=lt |date=19 February 2024 |access-date=19 February 2024 |archive-date=19 February 2024 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240219094656/https://www.15min.lt/naujiena/aktualu/lietuva/atsisakyta-registruoti-petra-grazuli-respublikos-prezidento-rinkimu-politines-kampanijos-dalyviu-56-2193910 |url-status=live }}</ref>

